<title>USA: Hayes Wheels gets Saab contract.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels gets Saab contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheel International Inc said it received a contract to supply cast aluminum wheels for the Saab 900 and 9000 passenger cars, beginning with the 1997 model year.</p>
<p>Hayes said it is the first contract it has received from Saab. Saab Automobile AB is a joint venture between General Motors and Investor AB.</p>
<p>The wheels are being produced at the company's Dello, Italy manufacturing facility, Hayes said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
